  "title": "· New Arrivals | Celine Launches \"Games\" Collection of Bags and Accessories, Inspired by Chess and Playing Cards ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Celine 上架「Games」主题手袋和配饰：国际象棋和扑克牌灵感",
  "excerpt": "Celine’s Spring 2027 “Games” capsule collection decorates bags and scarves with checkerboards, card suits, and whimsical Jungle Chess characters.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-11-19",
