    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Celine has just launched its Spring 2027 \"Games\" capsule collection, drawing inspiration from chess, card games, board games, marbles, and more. The new pieces adorn bags and scarves with black-and-white checkerboard patterns and playing-card suits, while anthropomorphic touches bring to life dancing elephants, galloping horses, white tigers, and other Jungle Chess characters—capturing a whimsical world of play across handbags and silk squares.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
