      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Checkerboard ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The small Boston bag and Soft Shopper tote cleverly render a contrasting checkerboard pattern in Triomphe logo canvas and pale beige print, with anthropomorphic animals—a small elephant, polar bear, galloping horse, hound, and dodo—nestled within the light squares. Bright blue Celine pieces punctuate the design, adding a lively touch of whimsy.",
