      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Dancing Elephant ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This group of bags stars the \"Dancing Elephant,\" its round ears flapping and long trunk curling, an oversized bow tie around its neck—its energetic moves evoke the twist from Pulp Fiction. Crafted in honey-colored logo canvas with matching calfskin trim and gold-tone hardware, the colorful elephant steps lightly across the bag, lending a joyful mood.",
