    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A card-case charm sets a black elephant silhouette against a bright blue background, finished with a vividly colored floral bow tie, its trunk cleverly extending to meet the strap buckle. There's also a Puffy Elephant bag charm, padded to create a plump, lively dancing elephant with topstitching outlining its edges—full of artisanal charm.",
