    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Playing-Card Suit Embossing ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Le 17 accordion bag, Trio horizontal bag and wallet, passport case, and other small leather goods are crafted in honey-colored calfskin, embossed with playing-card suits—spades, diamonds, hearts, clubs—and the brand's signature Triomphe emblem. The fine, delicate embossing enhances the leather's texture, while the classic earth tones exude a retro collegiate air.",
